sequenceDiagram
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines SDK<br/>(Pipeline Step)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC (HTTP/2)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL Database<br/>5432/TCP

    Note over KFP,PG: Flow 1: Pipeline Execution Metadata Recording

    KFP->>MLMD: PutExecutionType<br/>gRPC/8080, Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>PG: INSERT execution_type<br/>PostgreSQL wire protocol, Optional TLS
    PG-->>MLMD: Type ID
    MLMD-->>KFP: PutExecutionTypeResponse

    KFP->>MLMD: PutExecution (atomic)<br/>Execution + Artifacts + Events + Contexts
    MLMD->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION<br/>INSERT execution, artifacts, events
    PG-->>MLMD: Committed
    MLMD-->>KFP: PutExecutionResponse<br/>(execution_id, artifact_ids)

    KFP->>MLMD: PutAttributionsAndAssociations<br/>Link artifacts to contexts
    MLMD->>PG: INSERT attributions, associations
    PG-->>MLMD: OK
    MLMD-->>KFP: PutAttributionsAndAssociationsResponse

    Note over KFP,PG: Flow 2: Lineage Query

    participant UI as Pipeline UI / Client<br/>(Lineage Viewer)

    UI->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph<br/>gRPC/8080, Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>PG: SELECT with graph traversal<br/>configurable hops & direction
    PG-->>MLMD: Lineage nodes & edges
    MLMD-->>UI: LineageSubgraph<br/>(artifacts, executions, contexts, events)

    UI->>MLMD: GetArtifactsByContext<br/>gRPC/8080
    MLMD->>PG: SELECT artifacts WHERE context_id=X
    PG-->>MLMD: Artifact records
    MLMD-->>UI: GetArtifactsByContextResponse<br/>(paginated, max 100/page)
